* ============================================================
* Idealized square-law MOSFET model (hard threshold, no subthreshold leak)
* I = 0.5*K*(Vgs-Vth)^2   for Vgs>Vth,  0 otherwise (hard cutoff)
* Bidirectional (same topology convention as igzo_die4.sub): I = I(Vgs) - I(Vgd)
* Ports: drain  gate  source
* ============================================================
.SUBCKT IGZO_SQLAW drain gate source
+ PARAMS: VTH=0.1510 K=1e-5

BIGZO drain source I={
+ 0.5*K*MAX(0, V(gate,source)-VTH)**2 -
+ 0.5*K*MAX(0, V(gate,drain)-VTH)**2
+ }

.ENDS IGZO_SQLAW
